{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/4874b5c4245abbd07d81463bada95103.avif?t=1767333243\" width=1367 height=763 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break through obstacles using your <u><i><strong>jumps</strong></i></u> and powerful <u><i><strong>skills</strong></i></u>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8&quot;Color follows function&quot;\ud83c\udfa8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every color in the game holds unique symbolism and functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <u><i><strong>Green</strong></i></u> represents elevation and ascent. Use the green skill with triple jump to reach higher and farther places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <u><i><strong>Blue</strong></i></u> embodies speed. Dash forward to travel faster and cover more distance. Combine it with a triple jump to clear long obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <u><i><strong>Yellow</strong></i></u> signifies gliding. Use this skill to float farther with reduced gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 <u><i><strong>Pink</strong></i></u> allows you to reshape the world. Transform terrain and obstacles to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ab <u><i><strong>Black</strong></i></u> grants a shield. While it's active, you won\u2019t sway from obstacles. When it breaks, it propels you upward\u2014use it for an extra boost! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Many more colors await, each with their own skills, environments, and items.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Red, pink, orange, yellow, green, turquoise, blue, purple, brown, white, gray, black... and finally, rainbow.</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the unique powers of each color. Understanding and mastering them is your key <u><i><strong>challenge</strong></i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Challenge yourself in the world of Lumen, where the wind never stops blowing.</strong>\ud83d\udca8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are '<strong>Phantom'\ud83d\udc7b</strong>, a challenger navigating the skies aboard the flying vessel '<strong>Blask'\ud83e\udebd</strong>, conquering each '<strong>Wind Zone'</strong> one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is your choice?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f\u201cTo overcome the wind,\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf3fThe reed bends,\ud83c\udf3f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf33The tree withstands,\ud83c\udf33</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udca5But the spear and arrow pierce it.\u201d\ud83d\udca5</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/f8aa65e40c4c743651838d110bde7c45.avif?t=1767333243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras_big/f8aa65e40c4c743651838d110bde7c45.avif?t=1767333243 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blask is known as <i>\u201c<u><strong>The Spear of Lumen.</strong></u>\u201d\ud83d\udd31</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom is called <i>\u201c<u><strong>The Arrow of Lumen.</strong></u>\u201d\ud83c\udff9</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you, too, carry the will to pierce the wind...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25New challengers are always welcome.\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\u26a1</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792930?t=1767333243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/c69f55db64bf436aec0ce7d0c928b49a9f7d23cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767333243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/855f26ab7bac8a86555f84951519db7ef96775fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767333243","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/855f26ab7bac8a86555f84951519db7ef96775fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767333243","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta