=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the unique powers of each color. Understanding and mastering them is your key <u><i><strong>challenge</strong></i></u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Challenge yourself in the world of Lumen, where the wind never stops blowing.</strong>\ud83d\udca8</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.poster.avif?t=1767333243\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.webm?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.mp4?t=1767333243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are '<strong>Phantom'\ud83d\udc7b</strong>, a challenger navigating the skies aboard the flying vessel '<strong>Blask'\ud83e\udebd</strong>, conquering each '<strong>Wind Zone'</strong> one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is your choice?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f\u201cTo overcome the wind,\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf3fThe reed bends,\ud83c\udf3f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udf33The tree withstands,\ud83c\udf33</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udca5But the spear and arrow pierce it.\u201d\ud83d\udca5</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/f8aa65e40c4c743651838d110bde7c45.avif?t=1767333243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras_big/f8aa65e40c4c743651838d110bde7c45.avif?t=1767333243 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blask is known as <i>\u201c<u><strong>The Spear of Lumen.</strong></u>\u201d\ud83d\udd31</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom is called <i>\u201c<u><strong>The Arrow of Lumen.</strong></u>\u201d\ud83c\udff9</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you, too, carry the will to pierce the wind...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25New challengers are always welcome.\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\u26a1</strong></h2>","developers":["Exovator"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/4daf53c14c55072719033d0081776184e452aa08/header.jpg?t=1767333243","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792930/801780462/857a5671990911b9e51726a0b6bd538fd738ebcc/1751412184/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752023578","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792930/801780462/857a5671990911b9e51726a0b6bd538fd738ebcc/1751412184/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752023578","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3792930/801780462/857a5671990911b9e51726a0b6bd538fd738ebcc/1751412184/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752023578","id":257164180,"name":"Pierce The Wind Game Play","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164180/cba8b1ac9b981e2e195f98a8ea4aad1